            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new polymerization strategy based on Sonogashira-Hagihara reaction and Schiff-base reaction at oil-water interfaces is developed to synthesize free-standing and thickness controllable conjugated microporous polymer (CMP) nanofilms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
